on Man to ask for his help. Stark and Sakurai join forces, when they discover the Zodiac Mech Aquarius may be behind both.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/mPhdRE9MsMW799A6iog6cHddonv.jpg","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"Episodio 5","synopsis":"Dr. Tanaka informs Tony that a mysterious epidemic has broken out near the Arc Station. The rampant and deadly disease appears unstoppable, and Tony initiates his own investigation into the cause. Meanwhile, the Self Defense Forces reconnaissance satellites are acting up, and Nagato Sakurai visits Iron Man to ask for his help. Stark and Sakurai join forces, when they discover the Zodiac Mech Aquarius may be behind both.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/mPhdRE9MsMW799A6iog6cHddonv.jpg","titleLanguage":"it-IT","synopsisLanguage":"en-US"}}},{"title":"Episodio 6","episodeNumber":6,"sourceEpisodeNumber":6,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"7723","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[6]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"6875","episodeNumbers":[6]},{"provider":"mal","id":"6875","episodeNumbers":[6]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"45418","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[6]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"193821","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[6]}],"link":"88019","synopsis":"When the Arc Station has a series of malfunctions, Tony and Dr. Tanaka discover a Zodiac computer virus has infected the Station's operating systems. The virus spreads to the city's ATM banking computers, train navigation computers and traffic controls, causing chaos. Tony decides the only way to combat the virus is to draw it to another computer... his Iron Man onboard computer!","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/qqjxCsnPiyb7IucWz16J86WLsKH.jpg","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"Episodio 6","synopsis":"When the Arc Station has a series of malfunctions, Tony and Dr. Tanaka discover a Zodiac computer virus has infected the Station's operating systems. The virus spreads to the ci